        Department 7TS2
        Broadcasting Division
        Muehldorfstrasse 15
        81671 Munich, Germany
        torsten.huebscher@rohde-schwarz.com"
      DESCRIPTION 
        "This MIB defines DVB Receiver/Monitor units
        of transmitting systems from Rohde & Schwarz.
        
        Use this MIB if your system meets the following requirements:
                - series XX8000 (SLx or XLx),
                - DVB Receiver/Monitor unit installed.
                
        The following MIBs are related to this:
        - RS-COMMON-MIB         - mandatory for this MIB
        - RS-XX8000-COMMON-MIB  - mandatory for this MIB"
      REVISION "201001210800Z"		-- January 21, 2010 at 08:00 GMT
      DESCRIPTION 
        "cmdDvbRecMonUserOperationOn added"
      REVISION "201001110800Z"		-- January 11, 2010 at 08:00 GMT
